2026-10-04T13:19:12.0806136Z                                         only, and navigation to file:// URLs is
2026-10-04T13:19:12.0806513Z                                         blocked.
2026-10-04T13:19:12.0806924Z   --blocked-origins <origins>           semicolon-separated list of origins to
2026-10-04T13:19:12.0807353Z                                         block the browser from requesting.
